| gộp | ru | объединени |
| gộp | zh | 合并 |

## Notes per locale

- The toggle is named "Kill Signature" everywhere. The Vietnamese source also calls it
  "Bypass chữ ký" / "Bypass Signature"; translations use "Kill Signature" so that one feature has one name.
- `pt` is European Portuguese (ficheiro, aplicação, detetado, fundir). Do not mix it with `pt-BR`.
- `pt-BR` is Brazilian Portuguese (arquivo, aplicativo, mesclar).
- `zh` is Simplified Chinese and uses full-width parentheses `（）` around counts.
- `ar` keeps Latin terms as they are, mid-sentence.
